{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a world of arcade nostalgia where you manage and expand your own arcade, while collecting over 500 Gachas to trade and sell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/StoreShowcase.gif?t=1746768317\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Setup Your Arcade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design and customize your arcade with cabinets, gacha machines, and claw games, setting prices to strike the perfect balance between fun and profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/PurchaseSetPrice.gif?t=1746768317\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Collect Them All!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Open over 500+ collectible Gachas yourself\u2014sell rare finds for huge profit or keep them to complete your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/GachaOpeningLoading.gif?t=1746768317\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Redeem and Reward</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Count the tickets won by customers and exchange them for prizes to keep them coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/TicketRedemption.gif?t=1746768317\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Expand &amp; Upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reinvest your profits to expand your arcade. Unlock advanced machines and create a one-of-a-kind arcade experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/StoreUpgrades.gif?t=1746768317\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Arcade Management Simulator</strong>, every choice you make shapes your journey. Can you rise to the challenge and turn your humble arcade into the most legendary entertainment destination?<br><br>This is just the beginning we'll have more features added as development progresses.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3475040?t=1746768317","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3475040?t=1746768317","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/cfedb8a6a13b6b4f65413c6dc79a1440f936f82b/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1746768317","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/cfedb8a6a13b6b4f65413c6dc79a1440f936f82b/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1746768317","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/Discord_steam.png?t=1746768317\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join our server using the link in the info section</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a world of arcade nostalgia where you manage and expand your own arcade, while collecting over 500 Gachas to trade and sell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/StoreShowcase.gif?t=1746768317\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Setup Your Arcade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design and customize your arcade with cabinets, gacha machines, and claw games, setting prices to strike the perfect balance between fun and profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/PurchaseSetPrice.gif?t=1746768317\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Collect Them All!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Open over 500+ collectible Gachas yourself\u2014sell rare finds for huge profit or keep them to complete your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/GachaOpeningLoading.gif?t=1746768317\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Redeem and Reward</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Count the tickets won by customers and exchange them for prizes to keep them coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/TicketRedemption.gif?t=1746768317\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Expand &amp; Upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reinvest your profits to expand your arcade. Unlock advanced machines and create a one-of-a-kind arcade experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/extras/StoreUpgrades.gif?t=1746768317\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Arcade Management Simulator</strong>, every choice you make shapes your journey. Can you rise to the challenge and turn your humble arcade into the most legendary entertainment destination?<br><br>This is just the beginning we'll have more features added as development progresses.</p>","developers":["Smash Game Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475040/d0e668a23b4ad39265c3bf524f0f366